# The dapr4s Wasm-component artifacts these examples build against. They are not on Maven Central yet (dapr4s wires
# their publishing but keeps it switched off): they come from a `publishLocal` of a PINNED commit of dapr4s PR #44
# (https://github.com/sideeffffect/dapr4s/pull/44, branch feat/wasm-component), so the classpath is "Central dapr4s +
# the local wasm artifacts":
#   - dapr4s itself: com.github.sideeffffect::dapr4s_sjs1_3:$DAPR4S_CORE_RELEASE from Maven Central (Scala.js IR,
#     linked into the component by the scala-wasm linker);
#   - local, version $DAPR4S_WASM_VERSION (sbt-dynver of $DAPR4S_COMMIT): dapr4s-wasm (the adapters),
#     dapr4s-wasm-glue(-exports) (2.13 WIT glue), dapr4s-wasm-scalalib-overlay, dapr4s-wasm-linker and the
#     sbt-dapr4s-wasm plugin.
# Once PR #44 is merged and the wasm artifacts are released, this file goes away: the plugin and the artifacts become
# ordinary Maven Central dependencies at a release version, and CI stops building dapr4s from source.
# Read by wasm/project/plugins.sbt, wasm/build.sbt, wasm/scripts/publish-dapr4s-wasm.sh and CI (.github/workflows/e2e.yml).
DAPR4S_COMMIT=9e644969017ba10deb220cf1b3646c5f205ab2ba
DAPR4S_WASM_VERSION=3.0.0+13-9e644969-SNAPSHOT
DAPR4S_CORE_RELEASE=3.0.0
